    "learnings": "Spend the existing escape-protection lifetime on accepted time-consuming combat inputs too. Free targeting and inspections must not age it. Expiry only removes stale route bookkeeping: current hazards, remembered threats, movement admission and mandatory progression pickups still require their normal checks."
